        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update webextensions.api.scripting.executeScript - injectImmediately support re <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/scripting#type-ScriptInjection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chrome documentation</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3306339494\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27539\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27539/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27539\">#27539</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27539.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3306339494\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27539\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27539/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27539\">#27539</a></p>",
